        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "type": "text", "text": "The sunflower centre is worked in brown and yellow before a " },
          { "type": "text", "marks": [{ "type": "glossaryTooltip", "attrs": { "termSlug": "colour-change-doily-l47" } }], "text": "colour change" },
          { "type": "text", "text": " to white adds the lace edge. A " },
          { "type": "text", "marks": [{ "type": "glossaryTooltip", "attrs": { "termSlug": "petal-round-l47" } }], "text": "petal round" },
          { "type": "text", "text": " in yellow surrounds the brown disc." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What you need" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            { "name": "Lace weight yarn (brown)", "qty": "15 m" },
            { "name": "Lace weight yarn (yellow)", "qty": "20 m" },
            { "name": "Lace weight yarn (white)", "qty": "60 m" },
            { "name": "3.5 mm crochet hook", "qty": "1" },
            { "name": "Tapestry needle", "qty": "1" }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Brown disc" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Magic ring with brown. Round 1: 12 dc into ring. Round 2: 2 dc in each dc (24 dc). Round 3: dc, 2 dc alternately (36 dc). Join." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Yellow petals" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Join yellow at round 3 edge. Round 4 (petal round): *ch 4, 7 tr into 4th chain from hook, skip 2 dc of brown edge, sl st to next dc; repeat from * 12 times (12 petals). Change to white." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "White lace edge (rounds 5 to 8)" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Work chain arcs and treble groups around the petal tips for 4 rounds, increasing evenly to keep the doily flat. Finish with a picot round." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Finishing" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Fasten off and weave in all ends with the tapestry needle. Block flat." }]
      }
    ]
  }
